{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and Marco's First Argument", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "It's All in the Past", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Around the World > Around the World", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify and provide solutions to problems in a range of social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Questions With How + Adjectives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">How</span> + <span class=\"italic\">adjective</span> in a question if you want to know how someone or something is.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use these types of questions when you catch up with someone and ask about other friends or family.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How old\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking about age\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How old are you?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How tall\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking about height\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How tall is he?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How far\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking about distance\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How far is it from here?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How busy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking about amount of work\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How busy are you these days?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "How busy is Peter these days?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "How happy is John, now that he is getting married?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About People's Behavior and Personality", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about  friends and family, you often describe their behavior and their personalities.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You are incredibly talented.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You cook so effortlessly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He's nervous about the job.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I admire how tenacious he is.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Behavior is the way a person acts or conducts themselves. </br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Tom is usually relaxed, but today he seems nervous.</span></p> Personality is a person's general character (they way they are). </br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Sandra is a tidy person. Her apartment is always clean and neat.</span>  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We use adjectives and adverbs to talk about behavior and personality. Remember that adjectives describe a person - their personality, while adverbs describe how a person does something - their behaviour. <br/> <span class=\"italic\">Examples: She's very intelligent.</span> (adjective) <br/><span class=\"italic\"> She writes intelligently.</span> (adverb)", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "effortlessly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "without effort; easily", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You cook so effortlessly!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about people.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "vivacious", "type": "name"}, {"content": "lively; full of energy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sally is so vivacious.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "refreshed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "energized; feeling rested", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She is refreshed after her travels abroad.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "thrilled", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very excited; very happy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She's thrilled to be back.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tenacious", "type": "name"}, {"content": "strong; powerful; not giving up easily", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I admire how tenacious he is.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "gregarious", "type": "name"}, {"content": "outgoing; lively", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: John is so gregarious.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of three friends you know well.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Think of 4 adjectives to describe each person.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe your friends to your partner. Do you they have similar qualities?", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I can describe my friends to my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "My partner and I can discuss the similarities between our friends.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le12ob07re2img07.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le12ob07re2img07.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Mmm ... this stir-fry smells delicious! Cheers to the cook!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Cheers to you, my sweet. You are incredibly talented in the kitchen and I have a lot to learn from you. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You're right - your stir-fry is the best and I did learn a lot watching you. You cook so effortlessly. It is something to watch!"}, {"image": "engenn6le12ob07re2img08.jpg", "time": "20000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: So, how's Sally doing? Is she back from her travels?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, she's back and as vivacious as ever. She seems refreshed and thrilled to be back.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: How busy is Peter these days? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: He's waiting to hear back from a job he applied to. He's so nervous about it. I admire how tenacious he is. When he sees something he wants, he goes for it."}, {"image": "engenn6le12ob07re2img08.jpg", "time": "42700", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Kind of like me, I guess. How happy is John, now that he is getting married?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Peter gets e-mails from him now and again. He sounds happy. John is such a gregarious guy. I'm not surprised he found love on a cruise ship!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le12ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le12ob07re2img07.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"c